---
// AerospaceSwissTurningSection.astro
// Entity cluster: CNC Swiss Lathe Turning + Grade 19 Beta Titanium / Grade 5 + Aerospace Fasteners & Hydraulic Valve Stems
// Technical depth: Micro-precision threading, stress concentration elimination, high-strength small-diameter turning
---
<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 2%, var(--theme-bg));">
  <!-- Engineering grid -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(var(--theme-primary) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--theme-primary) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full border" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent); border-color: var(--theme-primary); color: var(--theme-primary);">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5" />
        </svg>
        Precision Swiss Turning
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--theme-text);">
        <span style="color: var(--theme-primary);">CNC Swiss Lathe Turning</span> — Aerospace Fasteners, Valve Stems &amp; Grade 19 Beta Titanium
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">
        Micro-precision CNC Swiss turning of Grade 19 Beta Titanium (Ti-3Al-8V-6Cr-4Mo-4Zr) and Grade 5 (Ti-6Al-4V) for aerospace fasteners, threaded inserts, and hydraulic valve stems. Engineered to eliminate stress concentration in high-cycle fatigue threading.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Technical Focus Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1: Swiss Turning on Beta Ti -->
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Grade 19 Beta Titanium Swiss Turning</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">CNC Swiss Lathe · Ti-3Al-8V-6Cr-4Mo-4Zr</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Grade 19 Beta Titanium (Ti-3Al-8V-6Cr-4Mo-4Zr) is the material of choice for high-strength aerospace fasteners and hydraulic valve stems — offering 1,240 MPa tensile strength with excellent corrosion resistance. Our CNC Swiss lathes hold micron-level tolerances on small-diameter (2–20 mm) bar stock, producing complex multi-diameter profiles in a single operation.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Swiss-style guide bushing support for 2–20 mm bar stock — eliminates deflection on high L:D ratio aerospace fasteners
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Multi-diameter turning, threading, cross-drilling, and slotting in one clamping — Grade 19 Beta Ti and Grade 5
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Dimensional repeatability within ±0.003 mm on diameter — essential for interference-fit fasteners and hydraulic stems
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Thread Stress Elimination -->
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.48 3.499a.562.562 0 011.04 0l2.125 5.111a.563.563 0 00.475.345l5.518.442c.499.04.701.663.321.988l-4.204 3.602a.563.563 0 00-.182.557l1.285 5.385a.562.562 0 01-.84.61l-4.725-2.885a.563.563 0 00-.586 0L6.982 20.54a.562.562 0 01-.84-.61l1.285-5.386a.562.562 0 00-.182-.557l-4.204-3.602a.563.563 0 01.321-.988l5.518-.442a.563.563 0 00.475-.345L11.48 3.5z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Thread Stress Concentration Elimination</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Aerospace Threaded Fasteners · Hydraulic Stems</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Thread root radius control is critical in high-cycle fatigue aerospace fasteners and hydraulic valve stems. Our Swiss turning process uses precision-ground form tools and micro-finishing passes to achieve controlled root radii with zero micro-cracks — eliminating stress concentration points that cause threading failure under cyclic loading in Grade 5 and Grade 19 Beta Titanium components.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Precision-ground single-point form tools for consistent UNJF/MJ thread root radii — eliminates notching fatigue
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Micro-finishing pass on hydraulic stem seal diameters — Ra 0.2 µm surface finish for zero-leak applications
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Full thread-form inspection via optical comparator — 100% compliance with AS8879, MIL-S-8879C thread standards
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom entity reference strip -->
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 50%, transparent);">
      <span class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Entity Cluster:</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">CNC Swiss Lathe Turning</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Grade 19 Beta Titanium</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Aerospace Fasteners</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Hydraulic Valve Stems</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">AS8879 Threads</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
